abstract: >-
  Companion artifact for "Trust Is Not a Score: Runtime Assurance Contracts
  for High-Risk AI Agents": a prospective synthetic holdout (24 episodes,
  72 action attempts) comparing a Runtime Assurance Contract implementation
  with a full stateful baseline against labels from two blinded LLM judges,
  with frozen hashes and byte-identical replay.
